":"ʿil'ma","verse_key":"2:32"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَنَآ","en_gloss":"(is) for us","transliteration":"lanā","verse_key":"2:32"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"2:32"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"2:32"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَلَّمْتَنَآ ۖ","en_gloss":"You have taught us","transliteration":"ʿallamtanā","verse_key":"2:32"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِنَّكَ","en_gloss":"Indeed You","transliteration":"innaka","verse_key":"2:32"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَنتَ","en_gloss":"You","transliteration":"anta","verse_key":"2:32"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْعَلِيمُ","en_gloss":"(are) the All-Knowing","transliteration":"l-ʿalīmu","verse_key":"2:32"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْحَكِيمُ","en_gloss":"the All-Wise","transliteration":"l-ḥakīmu","verse_key":"2:32"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٣٢","en_gloss":"(32)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:32"}]},{"verse_key":"2:33","surah":2,"ayah":33,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَ يَـٰٓـَٔادَمُ أَنۢبِئْهُم بِأَسْمَآئِهِمْ ۖ فَلَمَّآ أَنۢبَأَهُم بِأَسْمَآئِهِمْ قَالَ أَلَمْ أَقُل لَّكُمْ إِنِّىٓ أَعْلَمُ غَيْبَ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ وَأَعْلَمُ مَا تُبْدُونَ وَمَا كُنتُمْ تَكْتُمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Then He said, ‘Adam, tell them the names of these.’ When he told them their names, God said, ‘Did I not tell you that I know what is hidden in the heavens and the earth, and that I know what you reveal and what you conceal?’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"2:33"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَـٰٓـَٔادَمُ","en_gloss":"O Adam","transliteration":"yāādamu","verse_key":"2:33"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنۢبِئْهُم","en_gloss":"Inform them","transliteration":"anbi'hum","verse_key":"2:33"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِأَسْمَآئِهِمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"of their names","transliteration":"bi-asmāihim","verse_key":"2:33"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَلَمَّآ","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"falammā","verse_key":"2:33"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَنۢبَأَهُم","en_gloss":"he had informed them","transliteration"