 were in. We said, ‘Get out, all of you! You are each other’s enemy. On earth you will have a place to stay and livelihood for a time.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَأَزَلَّهُمَا","en_gloss":"Then made [both of] them slip","transliteration":"fa-azallahumā","verse_key":"2:36"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ","en_gloss":"the Shaitaan","transliteration":"l-shayṭānu","verse_key":"2:36"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَنْهَا","en_gloss":"from it","transliteration":"ʿanhā","verse_key":"2:36"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَأَخْرَجَهُمَا","en_gloss":"and he got [both of] them out","transliteration":"fa-akhrajahumā","verse_key":"2:36"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِمَّا","en_gloss":"from what","transliteration":"mimmā","verse_key":"2:36"},{"pos":6,"ar":"كَانَا","en_gloss":"they [both] were","transliteration":"kānā","verse_key":"2:36"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فِيهِ ۖ","en_gloss":"in [it]","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"2:36"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَقُلْنَا","en_gloss":"And We said","transliteration":"waqul'nā","verse_key":"2:36"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱهْبِطُوا۟","en_gloss":"Go down (all of you)","transliteration":"ih'biṭū","verse_key":"2:36"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بَعْضُكُمْ","en_gloss":"some of you","transliteration":"baʿḍukum","verse_key":"2:36"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لِبَعْضٍ","en_gloss":"to others","transliteration":"libaʿḍin","verse_key":"2:36"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَدُوٌّۭ ۖ","en_gloss":"(as) enemy","transliteration":"ʿaduwwun","verse_key":"2:36"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَلَكُمْ","en_gloss":"and for you","transliteration":"walakum","verse_key":"2:36"},{"pos":14,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"2:36"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"2:36"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مُسْتَقَرٌّۭ","en_gloss":"(is) a dwelling place","transliteration":"mus'taqarrun","verse_key":"2:36"},{"pos":17,"ar":"وَمَتَـٰعٌ","en_gloss":"and a provision","transliteration":"wamatāʿun","verse_key":"2:36"},{"pos":18,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"for","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"2:36"},{"pos":19,"ar":"حِينٍۢ","en_gloss":"a period","transliteration":"ḥīnin","verse_key":"2:36"},{"pos":20,"ar":"٣٦","en_gloss":"(36)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:36"}]},{"verse_key":"2:37","surah":2,"ayah":37,"ar_uthmani":"فَتَلَقَّىٰٓ ءَادَمُ مِن رَّبِّهِۦ كَلِمَـٰتٍ فَتَابَ عَلَيْهِ ۚ إِنَّهُۥ هُوَ ٱلتَّوَّابُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Then Adam received some words from his Lord and He accepted his repentance: He is the Ever Relenting, the Most Merciful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَتَلَقَّىٰٓ","en_gloss":"Then received","transliteration":"fatalaqqā","verse_key":"2:37"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَادَمُ","en_gloss":"Adam","transliteration":"ādamu","verse_key":"2:37"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:37"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رَّبِّهِۦ","en_gloss":"his Lord","transliteration":"rabbihi","verse_key":"2:37"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كَلِمَـٰتٍۢ","en_gloss":"words","transliteration":"kalimātin","verse_key":"2:37"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَتَابَ","en_gloss":"So (his Lord) turned","transliteration":"fatāba","verse_key":"2:37"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَلَيْهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"towards him","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","verse_key":"2:37"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"Indeed He","transliteration":"innahu","verse_key":"2:37"},{"pos":9,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"He","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"2:37"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلتَّوَّابُ","en_gloss":"(is) the Oft-returning (to mercy)","transliteration":"l-tawābu","verse_key":"2:37"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلرَّحِيمُ","en_gloss":"the Most Merciful","transliteration":"l-raḥīmu","verse_key":"2:37"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٣٧","en_gloss":"(37)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:37"}]}]}